@faux testdata/faux/qa/commands-baseline.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE turn one
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Sure, working on it/ 20
TYPE /compact
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Context compacted|Nothing to compact yet/ 20
SHOT compacted
EXPECT /Context compacted|Nothing to compact yet/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
